              "summary": "ViTrox’s latest reported results show rapid revenue and earnings growth, with coverage linking demand to automated inspection for AI infrastructure and networking. The demand outlook is promising but its breadth and durability remain unclear because segment, customer, and order visibility are limited. Recent price weakness contrasts with strong one-year price performance, while valuation context remains constrained by incomplete earnings-basis and peer evidence.",
